%% Scope: eligibility and manual run lifecycle over an existing approved snapshot. Import behavior is diagrammed in 05-sequences.mmd. Requirements: CUS03-CUS08, SR05-SR17, SR28-SR30.
flowchart TD
  start([Select existing data scope and skill combination]) --> owner{Authenticated owner?}
  owner -- no --> deny[Reject unauthenticated request]
  owner -- yes --> prep[Build versioned deterministic snapshot]
  prep --> eligibility[Evaluate skill rules deterministically]
  eligibility --> enough{All required inputs/coverage available?}
  enough -- no --> explain[Ineligible + unmet rules; zero model calls]
  enough -- yes --> choose[User confirms all eligible skills, scope, one connection/model]
  choose --> pin[Pin Run and one child execution per selected skill]
  pin --> invoke[Invoke selected adapter for each child]
  invoke --> outcome{Response valid and evidence resolves?}
  outcome -- no --> failed[Append failed child and safe failure artifact]
  outcome -- yes --> saved[Append validated child result and lineage]
  failed --> aggregate[Derive aggregate Run state: failed, partial, or succeeded]
  saved --> aggregate
  aggregate --> read[Authorized dashboard/API reads saved data]
